---
pagination:
  data: collections.contentTypeHubs
  size: 1
  alias: hub
layout: layouts/home.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ hub.label }}"
  permalink: "/type/{{ hub.id }}/"
---

{# 2CDE Pass 1: one listing per canonical CONTENT TYPE (news, guide, analysis,
   chit-chat, merch). Same pattern and data source as game.njk: membership is
   derived structured metadata; no article was edited to appear here. A type
   with no articles yet still gets its page, so the nav never 404s.
   NOTE: postslist.njk uses the ASYNC `coverimage` shortcode; including it
   inside an {% if %} silently drops all output, so it stays top-level. #}
{% set postslistTitle = hub.label %}
{% set postslist = hub.posts %}
{% include "./_includes/components/postslist.njk" %}
{% if not hub.posts.length %}
<p class="mt-6 text-zinc-400">這個分類暫時未有文章，敬請期待。</p>
{% endif %}
